n><span class=\"rounded-md border border-fuchsia-500/30 bg-fuchsia-600/5 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs text-fuchsia-700 dark:text-fuchsia-300\">#<!-- -->Startup</span></div><h1 class=\"mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight sm:text-4xl\">Last Week&#x27;s Report from Clubhouse + Introduction to Several Useful Websites</h1><div class=\"relative mt-7 aspect-[16/9] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-lg\"><img alt=\"Last Week&#x27;s Report from Clubhouse + Introduction to Several Useful Websites\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 768px, 100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fphoto_%DB%B2%DB%B0%DB%B2%DB%B1-%DB%B1%DB%B1-%DB%B1%DB%B3_%DB%B1%DB%B7-%DB%B2%DB%B5-%DB%B1%DB%B7.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fphoto_%DB%B2%DB%B0%DB%B2%DB%B1-%DB%B1%DB%B1-%DB%B1%DB%B3_%DB%B1%DB%B7-%DB%B2%DB%B5-%DB%B1%DB%B7.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fphoto_%DB%B2%DB%B0%DB%B2%DB%B1-%DB%B1%DB%B1-%DB%B1%DB%B3_%DB%B1%DB%B7-%DB%B2%DB%B5-%DB%B1%DB%B7.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fphoto_%DB%B2%DB%B0%DB%B2%DB%B1-%DB%B1%DB%B1-%DB%B1%DB%B3_%DB%B1%DB%B7-%DB%B2%DB%B5-%DB%B1%DB%B7.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fphoto_%DB%B2%DB%B0%DB%B2%DB%B1-%DB%B1%DB%B1-%DB%B1%DB%B3_%DB%B1%DB%B7-%DB%B2%DB%B5-%DB%B1%DB%B7.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fphoto_%DB%B2%DB%B0%DB%B2%DB%B1-%DB%B1%DB%B1-%DB%B1%DB%B3_%DB%B1%DB%B7-%DB%B2%DB%B5-%DB%B1%DB%B7.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fphoto_%DB%B2%DB%B0%DB%B2%DB%B1-%DB%B1%DB%B1-%DB%B1%DB%B3_%DB%B1%DB%B7-%DB%B2%DB%B5-%DB%B1%DB%B7.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fphoto_%DB%B2%DB%B0%DB%B2%DB%B1-%DB%B1%DB%B1-%DB%B1%DB%B3_%DB%B1%DB%B7-%DB%B2%DB%B5-%DB%B1%DB%B7.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fphoto_%DB%B2%DB%B0%DB%B2%DB%B1-%DB%B1%DB%B1-%DB%B1%DB%B3_%DB%B1%DB%B7-%DB%B2%DB%B5-%DB%B1%DB%B7.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"prose-blog mt-8\" dir=\"ltr\"><h4>Hello and greetings</h4>\n<h2>In the past week, we had rooms in the <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d8%a8%d8%b1%da%af%d8%b2%d8%a7%d8%b1%db%8c-%d8%b1%d9%88%d9%85-%da%a9%d9%84%d8%a7%d8%a8-%d9%87%d8%a7%d9%88%d8%b3-%d8%a8%d8%a7-%d9%85%d9%88%d8%b6%d9%88%d8%b9-%d8%a7%d8%b3%d8%aa%d8%a7%d8%b1%d8%aa-%d8%a7/\" rel=\"noopener\">clubhouse</a> app every day and night with experts. With friendly discussion topics, we held a room in Clubhouse every night except Friday, November 12th.</h2>\n<h3>Our topics included keywords such as \"friendly discussion, hiring, collaboration, startup, programming, UX/UI, team building, and ...\"</h3>\n<h3>One of the goals I personally focus on is networking and connecting with people from different IT fields, and fortunately this week, I was able to connect with many individuals.</h3>\n<h3>In friendly discussions, people often share their mental and work concerns, sometimes they share their experiences, which is very helpful for newcomers.</h3>\n<h3>I often saw that when a question was raised, several people would answer it, and this participation encouraged us.</h3>\n<h3>We had useful discussions about the work experiences of programmers inside and outside the country, but the section about people's experiences working outside of Iran was more interesting to me.</h3>\n<h3>The work systems used outside of Iran are much more regulated and organized. Of course, many of these practices are also becoming institutionalized in large Iranian companies.</h3>\n<h2>The number of websites introduced in the <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d8%a8%d8%b1%da%af%d8%b2%d8%a7%d8%b1%db%8c-%d8%b1%d9%88%d9%85-%d8%a8%d8%a7-%d9%85%d9%88%d8%b6%d9%88%d8%b9-%d8%aa%d8%ba%db%8c%db%8c%d8%b1-%d8%af%d8%b1-%da%a9%d9%84%d8%a7%d8%a8-%d9%87%d8%a7%d9%88%d8%b6/\" rel=\"noopener\">Clubhouse</a> rooms this week was very high. I can say I will put the most important ones here and will continue to do so.</h2>\n<h3>1- Website <a title=\"The world's first and largest startup accelerator\" href=\"https://www.ycombinator.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://www.ycombinator.com</a></h3>\n<h3>In short, it's the world's first and largest startup accelerator. It's one of the first and most famous websites for startups.</h3>\n<h3>2- Website <a title=\"GitHub\" href=\"https://github.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://github.com</a></h3>\n<h3>This is a very familiar and public place for software developers where you can share your code and many other features. If you are a developer, programmer, etc., you must definitely create an account on this site.</h3>\n<h3>3- Social network <a title=\"The LinkedIn social network\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">LINkedin.com</a></h3>\n<h3>The LinkedIn social network is very famous for professionals in all fields. If you are not familiar with it, it's better to register in this network as soon as possible.</h3>\n<p> </p>\n<h3>Do you want to join us? In the contact section! My Clubhouse ID is there.</h3>\n<h3>Thank you - Mehrdad</h3>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Short Link<br />\n<a title=\"Last week's report from Clubhouse\" href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/3qx3\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>https://mehrdad.ir/3qx3</strong></a></p></div><aside aria-label=\"Ready to turn this into a product?\" class=\"mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-violet-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-600/10 to-fuchsia-600/10 p-5 sm:p-6\"><h2 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rocket h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-violet-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.5 16.5c